              "option_id": "opt_story_145_e2_vip",
              "label": "Ask Zoe what happened last Tuesday night",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": "Zoe, tell me the truth—what happened when I blacked out last Tuesday?!",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n07b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07a",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "bestie",
          "text": "WAIT A SECOND! That means... if your features are flipped, then YOU aren’t the one trapped inside!",
